<title>美西哩程開票對照表</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

  :root{
    --bg:#eef1f0;
    --surface:#ffffff;
    --surface-2:#e2e8e6;
    --line:#cdd6d3;
    --ink:#16232a;
    --ink-muted:#57676c;
    --accent:#0f7a86;
    --accent-ink:#ffffff;
    --good:#1f8a5c;
    --good-bg:#e3f3ea;
    --good-line:#bfe3cd;
    --warn:#b8591f;
    --warn-bg:#faeadb;
    --warn-line:#eecda3;
    --gold:#c98a2c;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --bg:#0b1415;
      --surface:#121e20;
      --surface-2:#182626;
      --line:#25393a;
      --ink:#e8f0ee;
      --ink-muted:#93a6a5;
      --accent:#48d3dd;
      --accent-ink:#062226;
      --good:#4fd08a;
      --good-bg:rgba(79,208,138,0.12);
      --good-line:rgba(79,208,138,0.35);
      --warn:#f0975a;
      --warn-bg:rgba(240,151,90,0.12);
      --warn-line:rgba(240,151,90,0.35);
      --gold:#e6ac4d;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --bg:#0b1415;
    --surface:#121e20;
    --surface-2:#182626;
    --line:#25393a;
    --ink:#e8f0ee;
    --ink-muted:#93a6a5;
    --accent:#48d3dd;
    --accent-ink:#062226;
    --good:#4fd08a;
    --good-bg:rgba(79,208,138,0.12);
    --good-line:rgba(79,208,138,0.35);
    --warn:#f0975a;
    --warn-bg:rgba(240,151,90,0.12);
    --warn-line:rgba(240,151,90,0.35);
    --gold:#e6ac4d;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Noto Sans TC','PingFang TC','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .wrap{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:32px 20px 80px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:28px;
  }
  .mono{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }

  /* header */
  header{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:8px;
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom:20px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  h1{
    margin:0;
    font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,34px);
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.01em;
    text-wrap:balance;
  }
  .sub{
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    font-size:14.5px;
    max-width:62ch;
  }
  .route-line{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    margin-top:6px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .route-line b{ color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; }
  .route-line .arrow{ color:var(--gold); }

  /* key insight */
  .insight{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-left:5px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:22px 24px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .insight .tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:11.5px;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .insight h2{
    margin:0;
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .combo{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:stretch;
    margin-top:4px;
  }
  .combo-card{
    flex:1 1 220px;
    background:var(--good-bg);
    border:1px solid var(--good-line);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:14px 16px;
  }
  .combo-card .lbl{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .combo-card .fl{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .combo-card .tm{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:13.5px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .combo-plus{
    align-self:center;
    font-size:20px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  }
  .caveat{
    font-size:13.5px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    border-top:1px dashed var(--line);
    padding-top:10px;
    margin-top:2px;
  }
  .caveat b{ color:var(--warn); font-weight:600; }

  /* questions */
  .questions{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:20px 24px;
  }
  .questions h2{
    margin:0 0 12px;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:700;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .questions h2::before{
    content:"☎";
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  .qlist{
    list-style:none;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .qlist li{
    display:flex;
    gap:12px;
    align-items:flex-start;
    padding:12px 14px;
    background:var(--surface-2);
    border-radius:8px;
  }
  .qnum{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--accent);
    flex:none;
  }
  .qtext b{ font-weight:700; }
  .qtext .ctx{
    display:block;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    font-size:13px;
    margin-top:3px;
  }

  /* board sections */
  .board{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:14px;
  }
  .board-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .board-head h2{
    margin:0;
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:800;
  }
  .board-head .date{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .board-head .date b{ color:var(--ink); }

  .table-scroll{ overflow-x:auto; }
  table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    min-width:640px;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  thead th{
    text-align:left;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    font-weight:600;
    padding:10px 14px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--surface-2);
  }
  thead th.center, td.center{ text-align:center; }
  tbody tr.city td{
    padding:9px 14px 5px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--accent);
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    background:var(--surface);
  }
  tbody tr.flight td{
    padding:10px 14px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:14px;
  }
  tbody tr.flight.dim{ opacity:.55; }
  .fnum{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-weight:600; }
  .times{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:var(--ink-muted); white-space:nowrap; }
  .times b{ color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; }
  .note{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-left:6px;
    font-size:11px;
    padding:1px 6px;
    border-radius:4px;
    background:var(--surface-2);
    color:var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .pill{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:5px;
    padding:4px 10px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:600;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .pill.good{ background:var(--good-bg); color:var(--good); border:1px solid var(--good-line); }
  .pill.warn{ background:var(--warn-bg); color:var(--warn); border:1px solid var(--warn-line); }

  legend.legend{
    display:flex;
    gap:18px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    padding:0;
    border:0;
  }
  .legend span{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }

  footer{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--ink-muted);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:16px;
    text-align:center;
  }

  @media (max-width:520px){
    .combo{ flex-direction:column; }
    .combo-plus{ display:none; }
  }
</style>

<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">MILEAGE AWARD · CALL SHEET</div>
    <h1>美西哩程開票對照表</h1>
    <p class="sub">全航段皆為華航／長榮系統查詢結果(BR 航班),資料擷取於通話前,實際開票結果仍以客服查詢為準。</p>
    <div class="route-line">
      <b>東京</b><span class="arrow">→</span><b>台灣(10/19 中停)</b><span class="arrow">···</span><b>台灣</b><span class="arrow">→</span><b>美西</b><span class="arrow">(12/24)</span><span class="arrow">→</span><b>台灣轉機</b><span class="arrow">(1/1)</span><span class="arrow">→</span><b>東京</b>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="insight">
    <div class="tag">Key Finding · 目前唯一有位組合</div>
    <h2>去程西雅圖 + 回程舊金山,兩段皆可用「豪經艙＋哩程升等」訂到確定機位</h2>
    <div class="combo">
      <div class="combo-card">
        <div class="lbl">去程 12/24(四)TPE → SEA</div>
        <div class="fl">BR026 <span class="pill good">● 有位</span></div>
        <div class="tm">23:40 起飛 → 18:10 抵達　<span class="note">同班亦可選 BR024 23:00</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="combo-plus">＋</div>
      <div class="combo-card">
        <div class="lbl">回程 1/1(五)SFO → TPE</div>
        <div class="fl">BR017 <span class="pill good">● 有位</span></div>
        <div class="tm">23:50 起飛 → 06:00 抵達(+2)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="caveat">
      <b>注意:這是開口式行程</b> — 去程降落西雅圖、回程從舊金山出發,並非同一城市進出。若堅持同城進出(例如都走 SFO 或都走 LAX),目前兩段都只能候補。其餘所有航班／艙等組合(見下方兩張表)皆顯示候補。
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="questions">
    <h2>撥打客服時要問的兩個問題</h2>
    <ol class="qlist">
      <li>
        <span class="qnum">1</span>
        <span class="qtext"><b>候補航班能否看到候補人數／順位?</b>
          <span class="ctx">例如 BR006 / BR008 / BR028 等直接兌換商務艙的候補班次,客服系統上是否顯示目前排在第幾位。</span>
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="qnum">2</span>
        <span class="qtext"><b>回程接東京段時,豪經艙被拆成兩種艙等,哩程升等點數怎麼算?</b>
          <span class="ctx">在官網搜尋 SFO→TPE→東京 選豪經艙時,系統把行程拆成兩種艙等(推測 TPE→東京段無豪經艙可選),需請客服確認這張票能否照原計畫買、以及升等商務艙實際要扣多少哩程。</span>
        </span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="board">
    <div class="board-head">
      <h2>去程 · 台北(TPE)→ 美西</h2>
      <div class="date">2026/12/24 <b>星期四</b> 晚間出發</div>
    </div>
    <legend class="legend">
      <span><span class="pill good">● 有位</span> 目前可訂</span>
      <span><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span> 需排候補</span>
    </legend>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>航班</th>
            <th>TPE 起飛</th>
            <th>抵達</th>
            <th class="center">直接兌換商務艙</th>
            <th class="center">豪經艙＋哩程升等</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="city"><td colspan="5">西雅圖 SEA</td></tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR026</td>
            <td class="times">23:40</td>
            <td class="times">18:10</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill good">● 有位</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR024</td>
            <td class="times">23:00</td>
            <td class="times">17:30</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill good">● 有位</span></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="city"><td colspan="5">舊金山 SFO</td></tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR008</td>
            <td class="times">11:30</td>
            <td class="times">06:40</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR018</td>
            <td class="times">19:50</td>
            <td class="times">15:00</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR028</td>
            <td class="times">23:30</td>
            <td class="times">18:40</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="city"><td colspan="5">洛杉磯 LAX</td></tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR006</td>
            <td class="times">11:20</td>
            <td class="times">07:00</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR012</td>
            <td class="times">19:40</td>
            <td class="times">15:20</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR016</td>
            <td class="times">23:55</td>
            <td class="times">19:35</td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="board">
    <div class="board-head">
      <h2>回程 · 美西 → 台北(TPE)轉機接東京</h2>
      <div class="date">2027/01/01 <b>星期五</b> 晚間出發</div>
    </div>
    <legend class="legend">
      <span><span class="pill good">● 有位</span> 目前可訂</span>
      <span><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span> 需排候補</span>
    </legend>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>航班</th>
            <th>起飛</th>
            <th>TPE 抵達</th>
            <th class="center">直接兌換商務艙</th>
            <th class="center">豪經艙＋哩程升等</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="city"><td colspan="5">舊金山 SFO</td></tr>
          <tr class="flight dim">
            <td class="fnum">BR007</td>
            <td class="times">12:00</td>
            <td class="times">18:00 <span class="note">+1</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR027</td>
            <td class="times">23:30</td>
            <td class="times">05:40 <span class="note">+2</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR017</td>
            <td class="times"><b>23:50</b></td>
            <td class="times">06:00 <span class="note">+2</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill good">● 有位</span></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="city"><td colspan="5">西雅圖 SEA</td></tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR025</td>
            <td class="times">00:10</td>
            <td class="times">05:20 <span class="note">+1</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR023</td>
            <td class="times">23:30</td>
            <td class="times">04:40 <span class="note">+2</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="city"><td colspan="5">洛杉磯 LAX</td></tr>
          <tr class="flight dim">
            <td class="fnum">BR005</td>
            <td class="times">10:40</td>
            <td class="times">17:20 <span class="note">+1 · 非晚班</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR011</td>
            <td class="times">22:35</td>
            <td class="times">05:15 <span class="note">+2</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="flight">
            <td class="fnum">BR015</td>
            <td class="times">23:00</td>
            <td class="times">05:40 <span class="note">+2</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
            <td class="center"><span class="pill warn">▲ 候補</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    航班資料為 12/24 去程、1/1 回程之查詢截圖整理,標示「非晚班」之航班不符合晚間 23 點出發需求,僅供對照參考。
  </footer>

</div>
